WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.710
Any day now, everything around us will be an agent.

00:00:04.280 --> 00:00:06.450
You might even get an agentic coffee machine.

00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:10.870
Yes, agent is one of the most overused words of the last year.

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:13.870
Still, the agents are real.

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:21.350
You work with them every week: for example Claude, monday agents, or the one your teammate built and promises is fine.

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:28.890
And when the result is weak, the cause is usually something you control, like a vague goal, which the agent fills with guesses.

00:00:30.040 --> 00:00:32.110
Which is why this adventure opens the lid.

00:00:32.860 --> 00:00:39.870
You watch an agent work on your real task and explain every move: plan, act, check, adjust.

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:45.070
Then you practise writing goals and leave with your own rules for any agent.

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:47.680
Even your agentic coffee machine.
